      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The incidence of low back pain and sacroiliac joint dysfunction and their relationship was studied in a sample of physically fit college students. An incidence of 26.5% was found for low back pain, while an incidence of 19.3% was found for sacroiliac joint dysfunction. This study found no significant relationship between sacroiliac joint dysfunction and low back pain."},
